--------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. RPC Firewall (in rpcfirewall/)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Upstream project : zeronetworks/rpcfirewall
   Upstream URL     : https://github.com/zeronetworks/rpcfirewall
   Upstream license : see rpcfirewall/LICENSE

   Our modifications add a new DRS Request-Inspection module (drsCapture.*
   and drsInspect.*), a deployment helper script (Deploy-DrsHarden.ps1),
   and four surgical wire-in edits to dllmain.cpp. See CHANGES-TO-UPSTREAM.md
   for the exact diff.

   The upstream base logic (Detours hook attach/detach, processRPCCallInternal,
   event log formatting, config parsing) is unmodified.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. Active Directory Firewall / DCFWTool (in DCFWTool/)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Upstream project : MichaelGrafnetter/active-directory-firewall
   Upstream URL     : https://github.com/MichaelGrafnetter/active-directory-firewall
   Upstream license : see DCFWTool/LICENSE

   We added one file: Set-ADDSFirewallPolicy.json — a config with lab.local
   values. The tool itself is unmodified.

